<h3>Enthalpy of vaporization</h3>
<p>
&#916;<sub>vap</sub>H = A exp(-&#945;T<sub>r</sub>)
 (1 &#8722; T<sub>r</sub>)<sup>&#946;</sup><br />
 &nbsp; &nbsp; &#916;<sub>vap</sub>H =
 Enthalpy of vaporization  (at saturation pressure)
 (kJ/mol)<br />
 &nbsp; &nbsp; T<sub>r</sub> = reduced temperature (T / T<sub>c</sub>)
</p><p>
<a href="/cgi/cbook.cgi?ID=C71432&amp;Mask=FFFF&amp;Type=HVAP-FORM1&amp;Plot=on#HVAP-FORM1">View plot</a>
Requires a JavaScript / HTML 5 canvas capable browser.
</p>
